@dbId = 1
@strategyId = 1
@errDbId = 2
@errStrategyId = 2
### 1. Registrar una base de datos (modo simulado)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/databases
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "PRODUCCION",
  "host": "localhost",
  "port": 1521,
  "serviceName": "XE",
  "dbUser": "sys",
  "password": "clave123",
  "priority": "ALTA",
  "active": true
}

> {% client.global.set("dbId", response.body.id); %}

### 2. Marcarla como ARCHIVELOG
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/databases/{{dbId}}/archive-mode?mode=ARCHIVELOG

### 3. Crear una estrategia (qué y cómo)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/strategies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Produccion diaria",
  "databaseTargetId": {{dbId}},
  "retentionDays": 7,
  "description": "Nivel 0 semanal, nivel 1 diario y logs",
  "responsible": "Alejandro",
  "destinationPath": "C:/backups/produccion",
  "active": true,
  "components": [
    { "componentType": "DB" },
    { "componentType": "CONTROLFILE" },
    { "componentType": "SPFILE" }
  ],
  "backupTypes": [
    { "backupType": "INC_0", "compressed": false },
    { "backupType": "INC_1_DIF", "compressed": false }
  ]
}

> {% client.global.set("strategyId", response.body.id); %}

### 4. Ver la estrategia (fijate en "notices": hay una recomendación de ARCHIVELOG y una advertencia por no tener programación)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/strategies/{{strategyId}}

### 5. Programar (cuándo): nivel 1 diario a las 23:00, ventana 23:00 a 04:00
POST http://localhost:8080/api/strategies/{{strategyId}}/schedules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "backupType": "INC_1_DIF",
  "cronExpression": "0 0 23 * * *",
  "windowStart": "23:00:00",
  "windowEnd": "04:00:00",
  "active": true
}

### 6. Vista previa del script RMAN
GET http://localhost:8080/api/strategies/{{strategyId}}/script?backupType=INC_1_DIF

### 7. Ejecutar manualmente (exitosa)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/strategies/{{strategyId}}/run?backupType=INC_0

### 8. Historial
GET http://localhost:8080/api/executions?size=10

### 9. Resumen de los últimos 30 días
GET http://localhost:8080/api/executions/summary

### 10. Exportar
GET http://localhost:8080/api/executions/export/csv

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/executions/export/pdf

### 11. Error controlado: una base con "ERROR" en el nombre siempre falla en el ejecutor simulado
POST http://localhost:8080/api/databases
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "PRUEBA_ERROR",
  "host": "localhost",
  "port": 1521,
  "serviceName": "XE",
  "dbUser": "sys",
  "password": "clave123",
  "priority": "BAJA",
  "active": true
}

> {% client.global.set("errDbId", response.body.id); %}

### 12. Estrategia sobre esa base
POST http://localhost:8080/api/strategies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Prueba con error",
  "databaseTargetId": {{errDbId}},
  "retentionDays": 3,
  "destinationPath": "C:/backups/prueba",
  "components": [ { "componentType": "DB" } ],
  "backupTypes": [ { "backupType": "FULL" } ]
}

> {% client.global.set("errStrategyId", response.body.id); %}

### 13. Ejecutarla: queda registrada como ERROR con RMAN-03002 y ORA-19504
POST http://localhost:8080/api/strategies/{{errStrategyId}}/run?backupType=FULL